{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is threatened by an alien force and bombarded with asteroids. You are the last hope to save the earth. Will you accept the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend Earth against alien asteroid attacks in this arcade shooter and experience the evolution of the genre in a gripping visual and auditory adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, Defend, Fail, Upgrade, Repeat and Strike Back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game is a classic arcade space shooter with roguelike elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your ship is destroyed, you can permanently upgrade it, provided you have collected enough alien tech. With each upgrade, the visuals evolve too \u2013 from 2-bit black and white, through retro styles, all the way to modern graphics \u2013 letting you relive the history of shooter visuals.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002010?t=1758057916","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002010?t=1758057916","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002010/c5527202a86c01332fa5b5350cb2c82cffd78ba2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758057916","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002010/c5527202a86c01332fa5b5350cb2c82cffd78ba2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758057916","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is threatened by an alien force and bombarded with asteroids. You are the last hope to save the earth. Will you accept the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend Earth against alien asteroid attacks in this arcade shooter and experience the evolution of the genre in a gripping visual and auditory adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, Defend, Fail, Upgrade, Repeat and Strike Back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game is a classic arcade space shooter with roguelike elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your ship is destroyed, you can permanently upgrade it, provided you have collected enough alien tech. With each upgrade, the visuals evolve too \u2013 from 2-bit black and white, through retro styles, all the way to modern graphics \u2013 letting you relive the history of shooter visuals.</p>","developers":["Stefan Amelung"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002010/b89d615d7ce88a5967db0868d3fd2e3f61d702de/header.jpg?t=1758057916","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191901,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191901/movie480.mp4?t=1757624725","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191901/movie_max.mp4?t=1757624725"},"name":"RePulse-X-Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191901/864bf5a9c8c6affc206e9115c45782d726f6b8f9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757624725","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191901/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757624725","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191901/movie_max_vp9.webm?t